{"title": "Athlete Finishes Hyrox Race After Fecal Incontinence Incident", "summary": "An athlete competing in the Hyrox Beijing race experienced fecal incontinence during the event but continued and finished. The incident led to the race organizer disinfecting the course. The athlete stated that 'win is a win' despite the circumstances. Reports indicate this type of incident is becoming more common in the sport.", "summary_points": ["An athlete experienced fecal incontinence during the Hyrox Beijing race.", "The athlete continued and finished the race.", "The race organizer disinfected the course following the incident.", "The athlete commented that 'win is a win'."], "title_hi": "Hyrox रेस में मल त्यागने के बावजूद एथलीट ने की रेस पूरी", "summary_hi": "Hyrox बीजिंग रेस में भाग लेने वाले एक एथलीट को दौड़ के दौरान मल असंयम का अनुभव हुआ, लेकिन उन्होंने दौड़ जारी रखी और उसे पूरा किया। इस घटना के कारण आयोजक को रेस कोर्स को कीटाणुरहित करना पड़ा। एथलीट ने परिस्थितियों के बावजूद कहा कि 'जीत एक जीत है'। रिपोर्टों से पता चलता है कि इस तरह की घटनाएं खेल में आम होती जा रही हैं।", "summary_points_hi": ["एक एथलीट को Hyrox बीजिंग रेस के दौरान मल असंयम का अनुभव हुआ।", "एथलीट ने दौड़ जारी रखी और उसे पूरा किया।", "घटना के बाद आयोजक ने रेस कोर्स को कीटाणुरहित किया।", "एथलीट ने टिप्पणी की कि 'जीत एक जीत है'।"], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasizes Hyrox changing competition rules after the incident.", "Highlights the athlete's apology and forfeiture of victory."], "center": ["Emphasised the athlete's statement that 'a win is a win' in the context of the incident.", "Highlighted the organiser's apology and subsequent pledge to change competition rules.", "Noted the disinfection of the race course by the Hyrox Beijing organiser.", "Included commentary suggesting such accidents are more common than perceived."], "right": ["Highlights the athlete's statement, 'A win is a win,' despite the incident."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["घटना के बाद Hyrox द्वारा प्रतियोगिता के नियमों में बदलाव पर जोर दे